meta {
  name: Create Tracker
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/tracker?name=btc
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

params:query {
  name: btc
}

body:json {
  {
    "symbol": "Amundi PEA Monde",
    "icon": "bitcoin",
    "currency": "USD",
    "value": 98452.30,
    "change": 2.14,
    "sparkline": [92100, 89300, 93200, 91800, 95400, 94100, 97600, 96200, 98452],
    "volumes": [3.2, 4.1, 3.8, 5.6, 4.9, 6.2, 5.1, 4.4, 6.0],
    "sparklineRef": "open",
    "symbolColor": "#FF8800",
    "bottomText": [
      { "t": "ATH ", "c": "#888888" },
      { "t": "73.6K 03/24", "c": "#00D4FF" }
    ],
    "sparklinePeriod": "7D",
    "duration": 10000
  }
}

docs {
  Creates or updates a tracker app (crypto, stock, currency, etc.).

  Each tracker is registered in the app rotation and displayed with a
  dedicated layout: icon + symbol, price, change %, a 63-column chart with
  volume bars behind a bicolor curve, and optional bottom text.

  The tracker name in the query param becomes the unique key.
  App ID in rotation is prefixed with "tracker_" (e.g. "tracker_btc").

  Parameters:
  - symbol: Headline, max 31 chars (e.g. "BTC", "Amundi PEA Monde").
    Scrolls when it is wider than the row. Latin-1 accents are shown as
    their closest ASCII letter; anything else outside ASCII is dropped.
  - icon: Icon name from /icons folder (optional)
  - currency: Currency label, max 7 chars (e.g. "USD", "EUR")
  - value: Current price/value (float)
  - change: Change percentage (float, positive or negative)
  - sparkline: Array of float values (up to 63 points, one per chart
    column, auto-scaled; a shorter series is stretched over the columns)
  - volumes: Optional array of float values (up to 63), drawn as midnight
    blue bars behind the curve, scaled against their own largest value
  - sparklineRef: "open" (default) or "last" - which price the curve is
    green above and red below
  - symbolColor: Header color - hex "#FF8800", RGB [255,136,0], or uint32
    (default: "#00DC3C")
  - sparklineColor: Deprecated, no longer drawn - the curve takes its
    colors from sparklineRef
  - bottomText: Optional footer text, max 31 chars, ten of them visible.
    Scrolls when it is wider than the panel. Accepts a plain string, a
    {"text","color"} object, or an array of [{"t","c"}] colored segments.
    Omit it and the chart takes its rows: 32 rows tall instead of 20
  - sparklinePeriod: Label set into the rule above the chart, max 4 chars,
    two read best - "7D", "1M", "3M", "1Y" (default: "24h")
  - duration: Display duration in ms (default: 10000)

  Stale behavior:
  - Data older than 1 hour dims all colors to 1/4 brightness, bottomText
    segment colors included
  - A red "STALE" badge appears in the top-right corner, and the scrolling
    headline stops short of it
}
